-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Jenna Miner,</b> The wife of <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Miner\" title=\"Mike Miner\">Mike Miner</a> is located next to the <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike Mines Shop</a>, at the main entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>. Jenna gives the quest for <a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Michael's Copper Axe</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>Jenna has some strange <a href=\"/wiki/Lore\" title=\"Lore\">Lore</a> surrounding her as she has been missing the Entirety of the Old Oaklands map, Players assumed she was either Missing or Dead according to the voice lines of Mike Miner explaining that he misses her and one day she just disappeared. But she recently returned to the Game when the New map was introduced. When asking her where she was, she would reply with \"I don't know what you are talking about silly.\" \n</p><p>Recently she was rotated to face the Mike Mines Shop and is now floating slightly off the ground . \n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav\" title=\"Template:NPC Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:NPC_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-imag